  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Destruction; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe wearer treats his elementalist level as 4 higher for the purposes of determining the bonus damage from the favored element class feature. This bonus does not grant early access to increased multipliers.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, favored element class feature; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp<br>\n<sup>For information on power charms, see Steelforge by Dreamscarred Press.</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
